menu "eyemech web"

config EYE_WEB_EXTRA_ORIGINS
    string "Extra origins allowed to stream poses"
    default "http://localhost:8080,http://127.0.0.1:8080"
    help
        Browser origins, besides pages served by the board itself, that may open
        /ws/pose. Comma-separated, each an exact scheme://host:port, compared
        without regard to case. The default is the eye-tracking dashboard served
        locally by `just web`, so it can stream follow poses straight to the
        board. A browser cannot forge its Origin, so these admit only pages
        served from the operator's own machine on that port. Leave empty to
        accept same-origin pages only. Non-browser senders send no Origin and
        are unaffected.

endmenu
